{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16593","headline":"逼寒节寄崔七 · 朱湾","name":"逼寒节寄崔七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲庭只是长莓苔，三径曾无车马来。\n旅馆尚愁寒食火，羁心嬾向不然灰。\n门前下客虽弹铗，溪畔穷鱼且曝腮。\n他日趋庭应问礼，须言陋巷有颜回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱湾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16593.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16593","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}